 "caveats": [
  "The official injury PDF prints game times on a 12-hour clock with the meridiem omitted ('07:00 (ET)' is 7:00 PM). Read as a 24-hour clock all 13 times it covers disagree with the games pages by exactly twelve hours. The conversion applied here is documented in the docstring of scripts/capture_2026_11_16_schedule.py, and the value stored in tip_et_injury_pdf is the document's own string, unaltered.",
  "Venue and city are not printed on the games pages; they are carried from official_schedule_2026-11-15_to_19.json, which took them from the official per-game cards, and each row names that file in venue_source.",
  "Records printed on the games pages are the standings through 2026-11-15; they are cross-checked cell by cell against standings_2026-11-16_1445Z_acc2fd9e.json."
 ],
